	(text_box "R_{RT} @ 2 MHz = 100000 / f_{SW[kHz]} = 50 kΩ\nR_{FBT} = R_{FBB} * ((V_{OUT} / 0.8 V) - 1) = 24 kΩ * ((5 V / 0.8 V) - 1) = 126 kΩ\nR_{COMP} = 4.67*10^{3}[Ω/A] * f_{c} * V_{OUT} * C_{OUT} = 4.67*10^{3}[Ω/A] * 15 kHz * 5 V * 100 µF ~= 35 kΩ\nC_{COMP} = (V_{OUT} * C_{OUT}) / (I_{OUT} * R_{COMP}) = (5 V * 100 µF) / (4.5 A * 35 kΩ) ~= 3175 pF\n\nL = (V_{OUT} * (V_{IN_MAX} - V_{OUT})) / (V_{IN_MAX} * ∆I_{L} * f_{SW}) = (5 V * (24 V - 5 V)) / (24 V * (4.5 A * 30 %) * 2 MHz) ~= 1.5 µH\nI_{L_PEAK} = I_{LOAD} + (∆I_{L} / 2) ~= 5.2 A\nL_{I_RATING} = I_{L_PEAK} + 35 % ~= 7 A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 50.8 0)
		(size 214.63 38.1)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
